#AI:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="src/**, app/**, {{project_slug}}/**"

LANGUAGE_RUNTIME:
- Python 3.12+ (fill in exact version pin)
- uv for dependency management — do not use pip install directly
- Virtual env at .venv/ — activate before running anything

BUILD:
- No build step for pure Python (or fill in: "uv build" for packages)
- Type check: uv run mypy src/
- Lint + format: uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format --check .

STYLE_CONVENTIONS:
- Ruff enforces formatting — do not hand-format
- Type annotations required on all public functions and methods
- snake_case for functions/variables, PascalCase for classes
- Docstrings on public interfaces only — one line max unless complex
- Prefer explicit imports over wildcard imports

FORBIDDEN_PATTERNS:
- No bare `except:` — always catch specific exception types
- No `print()` in production paths — use logging module
- No mutable default arguments (e.g., `def f(x=[])`)
- No hardcoded secrets or environment-specific values in source

EXPLICITLY_NOT_TOUCHING:
- (fill in: generated code, migration files if hands-off, etc.)
